# Byte-fidelity for generated artefacts.
#
# The sample dataset is hashed in its manifest, and NDJSON exports are promised
# to be byte-identical to the input. With the Windows default (core.autocrlf)
# Git would rewrite line endings on checkout, so opt these files out of any
# text conversion. Same for the pre-built report, which embeds that data.
*.ndjson -text
*.html -text
*.png binary
